# Documate — Memory and workflow

- Implement the **minimum** scope requested.
- Do not invent **product** behavior in engineering tasks (point to product plans).
- Do not redefine folder/CQRS conventions in product tasks (point to `docs/architecture/`).
- Do not modify `old_code/` unless a DQ says so (`docs/architecture/governance/preservation-rules.md`).
- Prefer copying an existing feature slice over inventing a new layout.
